 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Support of the constructed composition center",
 "statement": "Under the hypotheses of\n[lemma-nagata-composition-center-ideal], the ideal $\\mathcal K(Z')$ is\nfinite type and\n\n$$\n|Y(Z')|=|V(\\mathcal I)|\\cup b(|Z'|).\n$$",
 "source": {
